{"id":"vod_lz_19153","vodId":"19153","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"欢迎来到加帕里公园","name_cn":"欢迎来到加帕里公园","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220524-1/fd19862c7d3d832131101adb6b4ead5c.jpg"},"summary":"坐落在这个世界的某个角落的超大型综合动物园「加帕里公园」，依靠着那里的神秘物质「砂之星」的力量，动物一个个都变成了人类的模样。变身成为「兽娘」，来访的人们把她们称为「朋友（friends）」。在热闹中享受着梦幻般的时光。在加帕里公园顺利开业之前，其实有一场巨大危机。这是讲述跨越危机的朋友们和「园长」的冒险故事。担任公园向导的未来小姐和曾经参与冒险的薮猫一行，将这个故事记录了下来。救公园于危机之中的众多朋友们和「园长」出镜的乱哄哄的视频记录，你也来看看吧？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-05-24 22:34:16","playable":true,"episodeCount":36,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220524/19639_3c4fb8b0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220524/19640_38c6c68b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220524/19641_771f60a0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220524/19642_a26f850d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220524/19644_ad98c3ca/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220524/19643_a6baf497/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220524/19646_5b84e639/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220524/19647_4c4ad128/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220524/19645_025ba256/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220524/19648_1302e1d0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220524/19649_f2c7cbe9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220524/19650_eea56bbe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220524/19651_5c076f0a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220524/19653_bcad3490/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220524/1965